+# Slice: shipping.cancel_shipment
+
+**Kind:** command · **Lane:** service-entity · **Status:** live · **Owner:** shipping-team
+
+## Invariants
+- `cancel-before-ship` — `ShippingOrder.cancelShipment()` refuses a shipped order and returns `false`
+  the second time.
+
+## Boundaries
+**Writes:** the `ShippingOrder` entity, through `persistence/ShippingOrders`.
+**Publishes:** `ShipmentCancelled` on the `EventBus`, only when the state actually changed.
